# A long value, in a view that scrolls and filters.
Shot inspect
Alt :inspect opening a view over a slice of 480 users, a row each, scrollable, with the count in its footer
Also inspect-filter the same view filtered to the users whose row mentions 042
Caption :inspect opens a big value in a view you can scroll and filter — 480 rows, no terminal flood.
Headline Big values, in a view
Grid 80x20
Line type User struct{ ID int; Name, Email string }
Line users := make([]User, 480)
Line for i := range users { users[i] = User{i, fmt.Sprintf("user%03d", i), fmt.Sprintf("user%03d@example.com", i)} }
Type ":inspect users"
Enter
Wait Prompt
Screenshot
Keys "/042"
Wait Prompt
Screenshot inspect-filter
